{"id":"54856408d268c013","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-threshreg.md","title":"Positive threshold functions are regular","display":"thm-threshreg — Positive threshold functions are regular","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-threshreg","aliases":["27-thm-threshreg"],"display":"thm-threshreg — Positive threshold functions are regular","depends_on":["[[27-df-threshold]]","[[27-df-regular]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-threshreg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-threshreg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-threshreg — Positive threshold functions are regular"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\">\\((w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in S_n\">\\(\\pi\\in S_n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;(r&lt;s\\Rightarrow w_{\\pi(r)}\\geq w_{\\pi(s)})\">\\(\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;(r&lt;s\\Rightarrow w_{\\pi(r)}\\geq w_{\\pi(s)})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succeq_f,S_n,\\mathrm{Regular}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(\\succeq_f,S_n,\\mathrm{Regular}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;\\left(r&lt;s\\longrightarrow\\pi(r)\\succeq_f\\pi(s)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;\\left(r&lt;s\\longrightarrow\\pi(r)\\succeq_f\\pi(s)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §8.1，Theorem 8.3（印刷 p.353／PDF p.377）及 §9.2 Theorem 9.7(1)（印刷 p.410／PDF p.434）；已核对陈述和前者证明。交换两坐标后，较大权重产生较大线性得分，因此权重降序给强度降序。</li>\n<li>完全强度预序适用于带负权的一般阈值函数；regular 还要求正性。原先“每个阈值函数均 regular”的文字已修正，避免把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)=1-x\">\\(f(x)=1-x\\)</span> 误归入正 regular 类。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-regular]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$，$(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)$，见 [[27-df-threshold]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi\\in S_n$ 且 $\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;(r<s\\Rightarrow w_{\\pi(r)}\\geq w_{\\pi(s)})$；$\\succeq_f,S_n,\\mathrm{Regular}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n","display":false},{"tex":"(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in S_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;(r<s\\Rightarrow w_{\\pi(r)}\\geq w_{\\pi(s)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\succeq_f,S_n,\\mathrm{Regular}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;\\left(r<s\\longrightarrow\\pi(r)\\succeq_f\\pi(s)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"f(x)=1-x","display":false}],"bytes":1261,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-582","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-threshreg|thm-threshreg — Positive threshold functions are regular]]"}],"outgoing":["d0db491e5f6359f5","6ae49270bb9c0b4f"]}